{"id":"999a16040e61108f","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-fractional-brownian.md","title":"Fractional Brownian Motion","display":"df-fractional-brownian — Fractional Brownian Motion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-fractional-brownian","aliases":["58-df-fractional-brownian","Fractional Brownian Motion","fBm"],"display":"df-fractional-brownian — Fractional Brownian Motion","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-gaussian-process.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-fractional-brownian"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-fractional-brownian</span><span>Fractional Brownian Motion</span><span>fBm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fractional-brownian — Fractional Brownian Motion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35044454ad233373\" href=\"?note=35044454ad233373\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-gaussian-process.md\">../batch06/58-df-gaussian-process.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,H\\in V\">\\(B,H\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GaussianProcess}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GaussianProcess}_S\\)</span> (Gaussian-process predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35044454ad233373\" href=\"?note=35044454ad233373\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-gaussian-process.md\">../batch06/58-df-gaussian-process.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FractionalBrownian}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FractionalBrownian}_S\\)</span> (fractional Brownian motion predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fractional\\text{-}brownian} \\vdash \\mathrm{FractionalBrownian}_S(B,H)\\leftrightarrow 0&lt;H&lt;1\\land \\exists K\\in V\\left(\\mathrm{GaussianProcess}_S(B,[0,\\infty),\\{\\langle t,0\\rangle:t\\in[0,\\infty)\\},K)\\land \\forall s,t\\in[0,\\infty)\\;K(s,t)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(t^{2H}+s^{2H}-|t-s|^{2H}\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fractional\\text{-}brownian} \\vdash \\mathrm{FractionalBrownian}_S(B,H)\\leftrightarrow 0&lt;H&lt;1\\land \\exists K\\in V\\left(\\mathrm{GaussianProcess}_S(B,[0,\\infty),\\{\\langle t,0\\rangle:t\\in[0,\\infty)\\},K)\\land \\forall s,t\\in[0,\\infty)\\;K(s,t)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(t^{2H}+s^{2H}-|t-s|^{2H}\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>fBm: Gaussian process with Hurst parameter H</li>\n<li>Long-range dependence: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H &gt; 1/2\">\\(H &gt; 1/2\\)</span> gives positive correlations</li>\n<li>Short-range: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H &lt; 1/2\">\\(H &lt; 1/2\\)</span> gives negative correlations</li>\n<li>Not a semimartingale for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H \\neq 1/2\">\\(H \\neq 1/2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>N. N. Leonenko, Limit Theorems for Randomly Scaled Averages of fBm</li>\n<li>Mandelbrot and Van Ness, Fractional Brownian Motions, Fractional Noises</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-gaussian-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"35044454ad233373","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-gaussian-process.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-gaussian-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"35044454ad233373","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GaussianProcess}_S$ (Gaussian-process predicate; see [[../batch06/58-df-gaussian-process.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,H\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GaussianProcess}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FractionalBrownian}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fractional\\text{-}brownian} \\vdash \\mathrm{FractionalBrownian}_S(B,H)\\leftrightarrow 0<H<1\\land \\exists K\\in V\\left(\\mathrm{GaussianProcess}_S(B,[0,\\infty),\\{\\langle t,0\\rangle:t\\in[0,\\infty)\\},K)\\land \\forall s,t\\in[0,\\infty)\\;K(s,t)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(t^{2H}+s^{2H}-|t-s|^{2H}\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"H > 1/2","display":false},{"tex":"H < 1/2","display":false},{"tex":"H \\neq 1/2","display":false}],"bytes":1285,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-549","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-fractional-brownian.md|58-df-fractional-brownian]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["35044454ad233373"]}